{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","极速变形"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入“变形”形态并对周围敌人造成伤害和嘲讽，变形期间消耗“火源”使其他技能效果增强。“火源”全部消耗后变回“本相”形态并对周围敌人造成伤害和致盲。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","赫普进入“变形”形态，对自身周围2格所有敌人造成230% + 35% ATK伤害并嘲讽其持续5秒；同时获得4点“火源”。\n赫普在“变形”形态下技能“倾囊相授”和“紧急避险”获得强化且冷却时间更短，但释放时需要消耗1点“火源”。“火源”全部消耗后赫普变回“本相”形态，同时对周围2格所有敌人造成230% + 35% ATK伤害并使其致盲持续5秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":150,"end":156,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":146,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","进入“变形”形态时造成的伤害提升至260% + 35% ATK，变回“本相”形态时造成的伤害提升至260% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","进入“变形”形态时造成的伤害提升至290% + 35% ATK，变回“本相”形态时造成的伤害提升至290% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","进入“变形”形态时造成的伤害提升至320% + 35% ATK，变回“本相”形态时造成的伤害提升至320% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","进入“变形”形态时造成的伤害提升至350% + 35% ATK，变回“本相”形态时造成的伤害提升至350% + 35% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","倾囊相授"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：对单体敌人造成伤害，并降低高额急速。“变形”形态：造成范围伤害，并击晕敌人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：赫普使用法术痛击敌人，对目标造成300% + 30% ATK伤害，同时降低目标60点急速持续3 + 0.3秒。\n“变形”形态：赫普重击目标敌人，对目标及其周围1格内的敌人造成360% + 45% ATK伤害并使其眩晕3 + 0.3秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":98,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":94,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：降低的急速提升至70点；“变形”形态：造成的伤害提升至390% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：降低的急速提升至80点；“变形”形态：造成的伤害提升至420% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：降低的急速提升至90点；“变形”形态：造成的伤害提升至450% + 45% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","紧急避险"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：使一名友军持续恢复生命。“变形”形态：使多名友军持续恢复生命并获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“本相”形态：赫普对最虚弱的友军施加治愈术，使目标在6秒内每秒恢复130% + 16% ATK生命值。\n“变形”形态：赫普对最虚弱的3名友军施加治愈术和坚硬皮肤，使目标在6秒内每秒恢复130% + 16% ATK生命值，并使其获得400% + 64% ATK护盾，持续15秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":119,"end":125,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":92,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":115,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","治愈术每秒恢复的生命值提升至140% + 16% ATK；坚硬皮肤提供的护盾值提升至480% + 64% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","治愈术每秒恢复的生命值提升至150% + 16% ATK；坚硬皮肤提供的护盾值提升至560% + 64% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","治愈术每秒恢复的生命值提升至160% + 16% ATK；坚硬皮肤提供的护盾值提升至640% + 64% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低自身受到伤害，处于“变形”形态时额外降低自身受到伤害。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低9%。处于“变形”形态时，使自身受到伤害额外降低6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低12%。处于“变形”形态时，使自身受到伤害额外降低8%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低15%。处于“变形”形态时，使自身受到伤害额外降低10%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","冬眠日"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","保护一名英雄，使其免疫首次受到的最后一击，为其施加护盾和治疗，同时将其暂时变形躲向战场后方。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时保护一名在自身周围一格范围内最靠前的其他友方英雄：当其首次受到最后一击时，使其免疫这次伤害，同时赫普为其施加持续5秒的治愈术和坚硬皮肤，并使其变为小动物逃向战场后方，小动物状态下该友军进入无敌状态，持续3秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"},{"start":36,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":99,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该技能提供的治愈术和坚硬皮肤的持续时间提升至7秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","赫普提高相当于被保护队友30%初始攻击力的攻击力，该队友获得相当于赫普40%初始生命值的最大生命值。赫普通过该技能获得的攻击力最高不超过自身初始攻击力的80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该技能提供的治愈术和坚硬皮肤的持续时间提升至9秒。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","消耗“火源”时使自身和被保护的队友提升护甲、魔抗并降低受到的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","赫普每次消耗“火源”时，使自身和被保护的队友永久获得6%护甲和魔抗加成，同时受到的伤害降低3%，最多可叠加10层。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","拟态之杖"]]}